		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Bullet Physics SDK 2.52 released and managed XNA version]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=4380#p4380"><![CDATA[
A new Bullet version is released, with several fixes for new reported bugs:<br><br>- 32-bit broadphase issue with static plane shape, thanks Dev0 for reporting.<br>- issue with triangle meshes without volume, thanks Phil Knight for reporting and help with a fix.<br>- getEuler issue<br><br>See <a href="http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=147573" class="postlink">http://sourceforge.net/project/showfile ... _id=147573</a><br><br>Also, there is full managed <a href="http://www.codeplex.com/xnadevru/Wiki/View.aspx?title=Managed%20Bullet%20Physics%20Library&amp;referringTitle=Home" class="postlink">Bullet XNA port</a> available (up-to-date Bullet 2.51, entirely rewritten in C#)<br><br>Enjoy,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Fri Jun 01, 2007 3:40 am</p><hr />
